OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 14 JUN
OL,4,G1200FPrivate Passions
OL,5,     GMichael Berkeley's guest in the
OL,6,     Gbroadcaster Jeremy Vine.
OL,7,G1330FMusic Map
OL,8,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch explores the
OL,9,     Gpathways to one of football
OL,10,     Gfanatic Shostakovich's most
OL,11,     Gcelebrated works, with Handel's
OL,12,     GUEFA anthem and balalaikas from
OL,13,     GJoe Hisaishi along the way.
OL,14,G1500FMark Radcliffe's Nature Ramblings
OL,15,     GIn the final part of Mark
OL,16,     GRadcliffe's Nature Ramblings, he
OL,17,     Gfeatures music inspired by
OL,18,     Grivers, including Wagner, Delius,
OL,19,     GSmetana and Joni Mitchell.
