OL,4,G1900FSunday Feature: The Mysteries of
OL,5,     FGwen John
OL,6,     GGwyneth Lewis explores the
OL,7,     Gmysteries surrounding the Welsh
OL,8,     Gpainter Gwen John - an
OL,9,     Guncompromising artist who
OL,10,     Gchallenged convention and led a
OL,11,     Gstrange and fascinating life.
OL,12,G1945FWords and Music
OL,13,     GFrom the diaries of Pepys and
OL,14,     GJohn Evelyn and the music of
OL,15,     GPurcell and Blow, and films such
OL,16,     Gas The Libertine.
